sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser<br/>(Vista Frontend)
    participant Vista as Vista FastAPI<br/>(Hub Server)
    participant OC as OpenCode Server<br/>(opencode serve)
    participant FS as File System<br/>(arch/ + specs/)

    Note over Browser,OC: Session Creation
    Browser->>Vista: POST /api/chat/sessions<br/>{provider: "opencode", model: "claude-3-5-sonnet", feature: "..."}
    Vista->>Vista: Create ChatSession<br/>Save to disk
    Vista->>OC: POST /session<br/>{title: "arch-chat-{feature}", permission: [...]}
    OC-->>Vista: {id: "oc-session-id"}
    Vista->>Vista: Map vista_session_id → oc_session_id
    Vista-->>Browser: {session_id, status: "ready"}

    Note over Browser,OC: Subscribe to Events
    Vista->>OC: GET /event (SSE subscribe)
    Note over Vista,OC: Persistent SSE connection<br/>for real-time events

    Note over Browser,OC: Send Message with Context
    Browser->>Vista: POST /api/chat/sessions/{id}/messages<br/>{message, attached_diagrams, selected_elements}
    Vista->>Vista: ContextAssembler:<br/>system prompt + diagram contents<br/>+ selected nodes + history
    Vista->>OC: POST /session/{oc_id}/message<br/>{parts: [{type: "text", text: assembled_prompt}],<br/>model: {providerID: "anthropic", modelID: "..."}}

    Note over Browser,OC: Streaming Response
    Browser->>Vista: GET /api/chat/sessions/{id}/stream (SSE)

    OC-->>Vista: SSE: event: message.part.updated<br/>{properties: {text: "token..."}}
    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: token, data: {"text": "token..."}

    OC-->>Vista: SSE: event: message.part.updated<br/>{properties: {text: "more tokens..."}}
    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: token, data: {"text": "more tokens..."}

    Note over Browser,FS: AI Edits Diagram
    OC->>FS: Write to arch/data-model.mmd
    Note over Vista,FS: watchdog detects file change
    FS-->>Vista: FileModifiedEvent
    Vista->>Vista: ManifestUpdater:<br/>check if new/deleted file
    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: diagram_changed,<br/>data: {file, content}
    Browser->>Browser: Re-render Mermaid diagram

    OC-->>Vista: SSE: event: session.idle
    Vista->>Vista: SessionService.add_message()<br/>Save assistant response
    Vista->>Browser: SSE: event: message_done,<br/>data: {role: "assistant", content: "..."}
